meta {
  name: Job Detail
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/schema/{{connectionId}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  One job with its steps (full commands, subsystem, database, last outcome), schedules ({ description, sharedWith, editable, msdb? | cron? }) and its last 20 job-level runs. `jobId` is a GUID for SQL Server Agent and an integer for pg_cron — anything else is a 400 before any SQL runs. Audited as JOB_VIEW.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}) plus **read** capability for the connection's environment — 403 otherwise.

  Errors: 400 malformed id; 404 no such job on this database; 503 { error, code: "CONNECTION_FAILED" }; 500 { error }.
}
